Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 06:53:02 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 43/43] Pin NumericalEarth to #938 (net_inflow, on #676) and
 Oceananigans to #6524 (NetInflow)

NumericalEarth fjp/net-inflow (e22c1bfd) is #676's head (b2eb617d: the inverse-barometer options) with
net_inflow on top; Oceananigans fjp/net-inflow-target (705b9e7c) is 0.117.2 with NetInflow. Neither
changes dependencies, and both new options are off by default, so the model's answer is unchanged;
the next patches turn them on. Until both PRs are merged and released.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Abhhvkp8Pai9cvvctGUDX5
